{"schemaVersion":"uapt-school-change-events-v2","revision":"v6-qs101-120-presentation-20261028","slug":"universite-toulouse-1-capitole","basisSha256":"86f34606cfb89445028c2a6b3f137815945958bd08b67006ac8bcd6a423bd44d","rulesVersion":"tracker-events-1.2.0","currentClaimIds":[],"themeOrder":[],"events":[{"id":"universite-toulouse-1-capitole:public-release-20260612-001","slug":"universite-toulouse-1-capitole","revision":"public-release-20260612-001","previousRevision":"public-release-20260526-003","publishedAt":"2026-05-31T20:47:00.000Z","url":"/changes/public-release-20260612-001/universite-toulouse-1-capitole","rulesVersion":"tracker-events-1.2.0","items":[{"id":"claim:claim-utcap-bu-iag-teaching-resource","category":"tracker_addition","theme":"source_status","claimId":"claim-utcap-bu-iag-teaching-resource","matchMethod":"none","newText":"The UT Capitole library maintains an official public page for teacher-researchers titled 'Enseigner dans le Superieur a l'ere des intelligences artificielles generatives,' describing an infographic intended to support informed use of generative-AI tools for learning quality.","sourceUrls":["https://www.ut-capitole.fr/accueil/bibliotheques/accompagnement-et-formations/enseignants-chercheurs/bu-enseigner-a-lere-des-intelligences-artificielles-generatives"]},{"id":"claim:claim-utcap-law-school-ai-source-status","category":"tracker_addition","theme":"source_status","claimId":"claim-utcap-law-school-ai-source-status","matchMethod":"none","newText":"An official Toulouse Law School page and PDF publish AI guidelines for law teaching; the source scopes the institutional AI-use framework to activities of teaching, training, and assessment within the Ecole de Droit de Toulouse, not to all Universite Toulouse Capitole programs.","sourceUrls":["https://tls-droit.ut-capitole.fr/accueil/presentation/lignes-directrices-pour-un-bon-usage-de-lia-generative-dans-lenseignement-du-droit","https://tls-droit.ut-capitole.fr/medias/fichier/lignes-directrices-pour-un-bon-usage-de-l-ia-dans-l-enseignement-du-droit-2-_1765547526800-pdf?ID_FICHE=105938&INLINE=FALSE"]},{"id":"claim:claim-utcap-law-school-assessment-boundary","category":"tracker_addition","theme":"teaching","claimId":"claim-utcap-law-school-assessment-boundary","matchMethod":"none","newText":"The Toulouse Law School guidelines say homework may be corrected for pedagogical purposes but should not count toward continuous-assessment grades except where AI use itself is evaluated; in that case students must explain their method, describe AI use, and correct or analyze results.","sourceUrls":["https://tls-droit.ut-capitole.fr/medias/fichier/lignes-directrices-pour-un-bon-usage-de-l-ia-dans-l-enseignement-du-droit-2-_1765547526800-pdf?ID_FICHE=105938&INLINE=FALSE"]},{"id":"claim:claim-utcap-law-school-data-protection","category":"tracker_addition","theme":"privacy","claimId":"claim-utcap-law-school-data-protection","matchMethod":"none","newText":"The Toulouse Law School AI guidelines strongly discourage using institutional professional email addresses with commercial, foreign, or paid AI services; they invite users to use personal/dedicated accounts or university-secured AI tools, and prohibit depositing sensitive documents on external AI systems.","sourceUrls":["https://tls-droit.ut-capitole.fr/medias/fichier/lignes-directrices-pour-un-bon-usage-de-l-ia-dans-l-enseignement-du-droit-2-_1765547526800-pdf?ID_FICHE=105938&INLINE=FALSE"]},{"id":"claim:claim-utcap-law-school-declare-ai-use","category":"tracker_addition","theme":"ai_tool_treatment","claimId":"claim-utcap-law-school-declare-ai-use","matchMethod":"none","newText":"For Toulouse Law School teaching, training, and assessment activities, the AI guidelines say AI use by a student or teacher must be declared when it contributes to work that is submitted, published, or evaluated.","sourceUrls":["https://tls-droit.ut-capitole.fr/medias/fichier/lignes-directrices-pour-un-bon-usage-de-l-ia-dans-l-enseignement-du-droit-2-_1765547526800-pdf?ID_FICHE=105938&INLINE=FALSE"]},{"id":"claim:claim-utcap-law-school-student-prohibitions","category":"tracker_addition","theme":"academic_integrity","claimId":"claim-utcap-law-school-student-prohibitions","matchMethod":"none","newText":"For Toulouse Law School students, the AI guidelines permit study-support uses such as summaries, explanations, plans, practice QCMs, and reformulation, but say AI must not be used to fabricate all or part of graded work and list generation of exam papers, homework, case comments, or dissertations as prohibited uses.","sourceUrls":["https://tls-droit.ut-capitole.fr/medias/fichier/lignes-directrices-pour-un-bon-usage-de-l-ia-dans-l-enseignement-du-droit-2-_1765547526800-pdf?ID_FICHE=105938&INLINE=FALSE"]},{"id":"source_added:https://tls-droit.ut-capitole.fr/accueil/presentation/lignes-directrices-pour-un-bon-usage-de-lia-generative-dans-lenseignement-du-droit","category":"source_update","theme":"sources","matchMethod":"source_claim_type","sourceUrls":["https://tls-droit.ut-capitole.fr/accueil/presentation/lignes-directrices-pour-un-bon-usage-de-lia-generative-dans-lenseignement-du-droit"]},{"id":"source_added:https://tls-droit.ut-capitole.fr/medias/fichier/lignes-directrices-pour-un-bon-usage-de-l-ia-dans-l-enseignement-du-droit-2-_1765547526800-pdf?ID_FICHE=105938&INLINE=FALSE","category":"source_update","theme":"sources","matchMethod":"source_claim_type","sourceUrls":["https://tls-droit.ut-capitole.fr/medias/fichier/lignes-directrices-pour-un-bon-usage-de-l-ia-dans-l-enseignement-du-droit-2-_1765547526800-pdf?ID_FICHE=105938&INLINE=FALSE"]},{"id":"source_added:https://www.ut-capitole.fr/accueil/bibliotheques/accompagnement-et-formations/enseignants-chercheurs/bu-enseigner-a-lere-des-intelligences-artificielles-generatives","category":"source_update","theme":"sources","matchMethod":"source_claim_type","sourceUrls":["https://www.ut-capitole.fr/accueil/bibliotheques/accompagnement-et-formations/enseignants-chercheurs/bu-enseigner-a-lere-des-intelligences-artificielles-generatives"]}],"counts":{"affected":6,"held":0,"added":6,"modified":0},"gaps":[],"provenance":[{"kind":"legacy","sha256":"3fda8af49d33a90bc39c0f317ad6bc789a703245edfdf746c6adc6733af7d30f"}]}],"coverage":{"recordedFrom":"2026-05-31T20:47:00.000Z","gaps":[]}}